      "content": "i hear you, but it's hard to see it that way. it's not just about being a burden, it's about the lack of control. i'm just watching myself fade out, waiting for some illness or accident to finally do the work for me. it feels like i've lost the right to choose how this part of my life goes. i'm just being forced to endure it.",
